title: "Graph-Conditioned Diffusion for Heterogeneous Data"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-23
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/DrNFRZM/graph-conditioned-diffusion"
authors:
  - family-names: "Nikbakhsh Jorshari"
    given-names: "Farzam"
    email: "nikbakhshfarzam@gmail.com"
abstract: >-
  A small controlled study of whether conditioning a mixed-type (Gaussian +
  multinomial) diffusion model on graph neural network embeddings of a
  user-item graph changes the fidelity or downstream usefulness of generated
  user profiles on MovieLens 100K.
keywords:
  - diffusion models
  - graph neural networks
  - tabular data
  - synthetic data
